flowchart TD
    A([Start performOTA])

    A --> B[Print 'Starting OTA Update']
    B --> C[Clear telegramUpdateFailedFlag]

    C --> D[Create WiFiClientSecure]
    D --> E[client.setInsecure]
    E --> F[Enable Auto Reboot]
    F --> G[Enable HTTP Redirects]

    G --> H[Print Firmware URL]
    H --> I[httpUpdate.update]

    I --> J{Update Result}

    J -->|HTTP_UPDATE_FAILED| K[Print Error]
    K --> L[telegramUpdateFailedFlag = true]
    L --> M([Return])

    J -->|HTTP_UPDATE_NO_UPDATES| N[Print 'No Update Available']
    N --> M

    J -->|HTTP_UPDATE_OK| O[Print 'Update Successful']
    O --> P[[ESP32 Automatically Reboots]]
